include locations/global

Bind Npc 18004 Zone 21

Quest 74 "Submission of the Exile Application Form"
    Journal "He will exchange your Exile Application Form with the item needed for the nation transfer."

On topics
    Topic "Submission of the Exile Application Form" goto event_410

On accept
    Goto event_410

On event_410
    Say "Well, I was looking for migrants, too! To win the next Lunar War, they're recruiting many soldiers. Are you ready for migration?"
    Topic "Submit." goto event_411
    Topic "Reconsider" goto close

On event_411
    Say "This definitely is an Exile Application Form."
    Topic "Confirm" goto event_412

On event_412
    Say "Then I will change the Exile Application Form to the items you need for migration and give them to you, are you ready?"
    Topic "Yes" goto event_413
    Topic "No" goto close

On event_413
    If player has 800360000
        Trade 1 of 800360000 for 1 of 810096000 for 1 days
    Else
        Say "Well... To transfer your nation, you should bring the Nation Transfer Certificate. You can buy the Exile Application Form at the Power-up store."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close
